      "description": "CAS - Central Authentication Service Login CAS notifications 2 Cookies Disabled Your browser does not support cookies. The browser's ability to store or read cookies is essential for single sign-on to work. Please consult your browser settings and ensure cookie support is turned on. OK My Lafayette My Lafayette, the campus portal, serves as a central interface to online services available to students, faculty, and staff. Enter NetID & Password N etID: NetID is a required field. P assword: Show password Password is a required field. CAPSLOCK key is turned on! * Indicates required fields By logging in via CAS, you agree to abide by Lafayette College's Acceptable Use Policy . Login Need help? See \" Managing Your Lafayette credentials \" for help troubleshooting sign-on issues. External Identity Providers AzureSAML © 2024 | Terms of Use | Privacy Policy Powered by Apereo CAS 🖥️ ip-10-1-7-164"
